<title>MEXICO: Coca-Cola Femsa nine-months net falls.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Femsa nine-months net falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p>	Shr	     n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>	Oper Income   316.69 million	     335.08 million</p>
<p>	Net	     227.21 million	     292.17 million</p>
<p>	Revs	    5.177 bln		5.016 bln</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Coca-Cola Femsa S.A. de C.V.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565</p>
